---
import SocialList from "@/components/SocialList.astro";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<PageLayout meta={{ title: "Home" }}>
	<section>
		<h1 class="title mb-6">Manas Ganti</h1>
		<p class="mb-4">
			Hey there! I'm Manas Ganti, this will be my personal portfolio page, whether you are a
			possible recruiter [hire me please] or just someone curious about my work and projects. You
			can find them all here. I'm a current student at Virginia Tech, pursuing my masters degree in
			Computer Engineering and will graduate by May 2027. I am particularly interested in curating
			Reinforcement Learning environments for agents and post-training for language and
			vision-language models across various domains; whether it be in robotics, healthcare, or
			autonomous systems.
		</p>
		<p class="mb-4">
			Most of the work is in measuring things before trusting them. That means leak-checking
			benchmarks until surface features score at chance, computing an optimal ceiling that tells me
			when a policy is cheating, and gating every expensive run behind a cheap check. When a
			training run doesn't move the metric, I write down why. Several of my
			<a class="cactus-link" href="/projects/">projects</a> are exactly that. I keep tinkering with ideas
			and exploring new ways to improve and validate my work and also hyper fixate on niche topics that
			excite me.
		</p>
		<p class="mb-4">
			Before this, I spent a few years working at Inmed AI where I worked on developing and
			deploying image segmentation pipelines for neuroimaging modalities particularly with Brain
			MRIs and CT scans. We developed products for radiologists working on diagnosing and analyzing
			patients with neurodegenerative conditions. My next venture was Assert AI a surveillance
			analytics firm where I developed and deployed computer vision models on the edge for real-time
			surveillance and analytics.
		</p>
		<SocialList />
	</section>
</PageLayout>
